From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Martin <dmanlfc@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 11:30:00 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] Odin: match the card name without DMI

OpenABL provides no SMBIOS, so the card's long name is the devicetree's
"AYN Odin" rather than the DMI-built names.
---
 ucm2/conf.d/sdm845/AYN Odin.conf | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)
 create mode 120000 ucm2/conf.d/sdm845/AYN Odin.conf

diff --git a/ucm2/conf.d/sdm845/AYN Odin.conf b/ucm2/conf.d/sdm845/AYN Odin.conf
new file mode 120000
index 0000000..1a8d968
--- /dev/null
+++ b/ucm2/conf.d/sdm845/AYN Odin.conf	
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+../../Odin/Odin.conf
\ No newline at end of file
